        },
        {
          "text": " Basi sasa ninyi, Tatenai, Mkuu wa mkoa wa ng'ambo ya Mto, na Shethar-Bozenai, na hao wenzi wenu wa Kiajemi, mlio ng'ambo ya Mto, jitengeni na mahali pale; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iacheni kazi hii ya nyumba ya Mungu, msiizuie; waacheni Mkuu wa mkoa wa Wayahudi, na wazee wa Wayahudi, waijenge nyumba hii ya Mungu mahali pake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tena, natoa amri kuwaagiza ninyi mtakayowatendea wazee hao wa Wayahudi, kwa kazi hii ya kuijenga nyumba ya Mungu; kwa mali ya mfalme, yaani, kwa kodi za nchi iliyo ng'ambo ya Mto, watu hao wapewe gharama zote bila kukawia, ili wasizuiliwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kila kitu wanachokihitaji, katika ng'ombe wachanga, na kondoo dume, na wana-kondoo, kwa sadaka za kuteketezwa watakazomtolea Mungu wa mbinguni, na ngano, na chumvi, na divai, na mafuta, kama makuhani walioko Yerusalemu watakavyosema, na wapewe vitu hivyo vyote siku kwa siku, msikose kuwapa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
