              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 132:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Na Mungu huyu, aliyelifanya jina lake likae pale, na aangamize wafalme wote, na watu wote, watakaonyosha mikono yao kulibadili neno hili, na kuiharibu nyumba hii ya Mungu, iliyoko Yerusalemu. Mimi, Dario, nimetoa amri; na izingatiwe mara moja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
